        ['The final bill', 'Whether the balance turns out positive or negative is not settled: it depends on how much clean energy powers the data centres, on how efficient chips and models become, and on what we choose to do with all this computing power. It is also a local issue, because new sites ask the communities that host them for electricity, water and land, and protests and legal challenges are not lacking. Here we also follow climate and environment news in general, when it helps to understand the context.']
